<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<title>trend-analysis-report</title>
<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}
body{margin:0 auto;max-width:52rem;padding:2rem 1.25rem;
font:16px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;
color:#1b1b1b;background:#fff}
h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6{line-height:1.25;margin:2rem 0 .6rem}
h1{font-size:1.9rem} h2{font-size:1.45rem} h3{font-size:1.15rem}
p,ul,ol,blockquote,table,pre{margin:0 0 1rem}
code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.9em;
background:#f2f2f2;padding:.1em .3em;border-radius:3px}
pre{background:#f6f6f6;padding:.9rem 1rem;border-radius:5px;overflow-x:auto}
pre code{background:none;padding:0}
blockquote{border-left:3px solid #d0d0d0;margin-left:0;padding-left:1rem;
color:#4a4a4a}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;display:block;overflow-x:auto}
th,td{border:1px solid #ddd;padding:.4rem .6rem;text-align:left}
th{background:#f6f6f6}
hr{border:0;border-top:1px solid #ddd;margin:2rem 0}
a{color:#0b57d0}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){
body{color:#e6e6e6;background:#151515}
code{background:#242424} pre{background:#1d1d1d}
th{background:#1d1d1d} th,td{border-color:#333}
blockquote{border-left-color:#3a3a3a;color:#b0b0b0} a{color:#8ab4f8}}</style></head>
<body>
<h2>Trend Analysis: {{ trend_name }}</h2>
<h3>Summary</h3>
<ul><li><strong>Trend:</strong> [Description — one sentence]</li><li><strong>Category:</strong> {{ category }}</li><li><strong>Stage:</strong> {{ stage }}</li><li><strong>Opportunity window:</strong> [Timeframe — must reference a quantitative anchor]</li><li><strong>Recommendation:</strong> {{ recommendation }}</li></ul>
<h3>Evidence</h3>
<table><thead><tr><th>Metric</th><th>Value</th><th>YoY</th><th>Source URL</th><th>Year</th><th>Page</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Google Trends</td><td>{{ index }}</td><td>+[X]%</td><td>trends.google.com</td><td>[Y]</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td>Market size</td><td>$[X]</td><td>+[X]% CAGR</td><td>{{ url }}</td><td>[Y]</td><td>{{ market_size }}</td></tr><tr><td>Job postings</td><td>[X]</td><td>+[X]%</td><td>LinkedIn</td><td>[Y]</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td>Investment</td><td>$[X]</td><td>+[X]%</td><td>Crunchbase</td><td>[Y]</td><td>—</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h3>STEEP Analysis</h3>
<p><strong>Social:</strong> [Behavior or value shifts driving this trend] <strong>Technology:</strong> [Enabling technologies and capability thresholds] <strong>Economic:</strong> [Financial drivers and macro conditions] <strong>Environmental:</strong> [Sustainability or climate factors if applicable] <strong>Political/Regulatory:</strong></p>
<ul><li>{{ rule_id }} ({{ jurisdiction }}): stage = [proposal / enacted / in-force], effective {{ date }}, impact = [accelerator / drag / killer / neutral]</li></ul>
<h3>Counter-Signals (minimum 3 required)</h3>
<ol><li>[Counter-signal with evidence]</li><li>[Counter-signal with evidence]</li><li>[Counter-signal with evidence]</li></ol>
<h3>Competitive Landscape</h3>
<table><thead><tr><th>Player</th><th>Position</th><th>Funding</th><th>YoY Revenue</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>{{ name }}</td><td>[Role in trend]</td><td>$[X]</td><td>+[X]%</td><td>[Strength or weakness]</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h3>Opportunity Assessment</h3>
<p><strong>Trend strength score:</strong> {{ weighted_total }}/5</p>
<ul><li>Growth rate: [1-5]</li><li>Adoption stage: [1-5]</li><li>Concentration: [1-5]</li><li>Regulatory clarity: [1-5]</li><li>Macro tailwind: [1-5]</li><li>Your fit + licensing: [1-5]</li></ul>
<p><strong>Personal fit filter:</strong></p>
<ul><li>Skills match: {{ yes_no_partial }}</li><li>Capital requirement: $[X]</li><li>Regulatory licence required: [Yes (specify) / No]</li><li>Available to enter: [Yes / No — if licence required and not held, STOP]</li></ul>
<h3>Next Steps</h3>
<ol><li>{{ action }}</li><li>{{ action }}</li></ol>
<p><strong>Next review date:</strong> [YYYY-MM-DD — max 90 days]</p>
</body></html>
